WEBVTT

00:08:29.716 --> 00:08:32.349
and we can get 90 percent
of toilets working

00:08:32.373 --> 00:08:34.532
in those 7,500 houses.

00:08:35.226 --> 00:08:36.407
(Applause)

00:08:36.431 --> 00:08:37.679
Thank you.

00:08:37.703 --> 00:08:43.997
(Applause)

00:08:44.021 --> 00:08:46.996
The teams do a great job,
and that's their work.

00:08:48.816 --> 00:08:50.932
I think there's an obvious question

00:08:50.956 --> 00:08:52.806
that I hope you're thinking about.

00:08:53.593 --> 00:08:55.545
Why do we have to do this work?

00:08:56.059 --> 00:08:58.699
Why are the houses in such poor condition?

00:08:59.271 --> 00:09:02.808
Seventy percent of the work we do
is due to lack of routine maintenance --